. * node attributes in nwergm must be numeric: encode the string variables
. encode race, generate(race_n)

. encode sex, generate(sex_n)

. 
. nwergm mesa, edges

Exponential-family random graph model

Network:               =  mesa
Nodes:                 =  205
Ties:                  =  203
Directed:              =  No
Estimation:            =  MPLE

